# Embedded UI

No npm, no bundler, no interact.js. Pointer events in `app.js`.

Composer steals jb2 Stage chrome (dark bars, cyan selection), not its now-playing widget. `PUT /api/slots/{id}` on pointerup, not per mousemove. Overlay is transparent; fade CSS only (~200ms).
